Agentic Stash is a universal, zero-runtime-dependency library and CLI for
deterministic record and replay of agent runs: it captures every source of
non-determinism during a run and serves it back on replay, and it can fork a
run, diff two runs, and seal a run with a tamper-evident integrity digest.

