THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

Agentic Stash has ZERO required runtime dependencies. Its optional peer
dependencies are sibling @takk packages, resolved only when the matching
bridge is used. Each is distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

  @takk/alkaline, @takk/keymesh, @takk/modelchain, @takk/behavioralai,
  @takk/noeticos, @takk/racs, @takk/gaptime, @takk/krikos, @takk/mcpcustoms.

The integrity seal uses the Web Crypto API (crypto.subtle), a platform
standard available in Node, edge runtimes, and browsers, not a bundled
dependency. The core pulls in no Node built-in; the CLI uses only node:fs and
node:process.

